    "detailed_description": "The government has tasked you a secret agent to infiltrate a Soda factory that has been using a unknown material nicknamed Element_3 to manufacture powerful soda weapons. You are to shutdown the factory from the inside via disabling five supercomputers. Use their own technology against them and breach your way through 25 levels reinforced with the factories security.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSoda Sabotage is a 2D top-down shooter. It has 25 five levels for the player to run the gauntlet with while dealing with 5 bosses along the way in order to complete their mission. Defeat the bosses and use their own unique weaponry to turn the tide against overwhelming odds.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey features:<br />\r\n-25 levels<br />\r\n-5 unique bosses<br />\r\n-5 unique environments",
